  "targets": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0092",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In sum, the same series of events can be related in different ways, made more interesting by story editing.",
      "sentenceSha256": "515311de979c779d50ef2bb24158501702e3d23394342c86988c15acce5d39ea",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-065",
      "parentFingerprint": "eaf60203298057b96377289679d70459d0d7d3b09fba5e10a6be13e40bb17d23",
      "passageSha256": "e26150536f7df9123aa55967c7dfcfbb88bde4a4a5e89584bec9a6f553484256",
      "pdfPages": [
        142,
        143
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0093",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "By emphasizing struggles and challenges, you can give your narrative a structure and transform it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "677acd5c7574a2e32d82b7b895a5d2d89b265d0368d5da95185c2f5ac233b900",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-065",
      "parentFingerprint": "eaf60203298057b96377289679d70459d0d7d3b09fba5e10a6be13e40bb17d23",
      "passageSha256": "e26150536f7df9123aa55967c7dfcfbb88bde4a4a5e89584bec9a6f553484256",
      "pdfPages": [
        142,
        143
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0094",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-s003",
      "sentenceText": "You can make the same story more like a hero’s journey by focusing on crises and how you overcame them.",
      "sentenceSha256": "674597814b00bd76ceb314cc59dbf7ba82ec5d47093af7d438ab8370d2b7e118",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-065",
      "parentFingerprint": "eaf60203298057b96377289679d70459d0d7d3b09fba5e10a6be13e40bb17d23",
      "passageSha256": "e26150536f7df9123aa55967c7dfcfbb88bde4a4a5e89584bec9a6f553484256",
      "pdfPages": [
        142,
        143
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0095",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Toni Morrison’s Song of Solomon is so good because the main character, Macon Dead III, nicknamed “Milkman,” is totally clueless at the beginning, and readers slowly figure out his family mysteries and what the “Song of Solomon” really means alongside him.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eab606505ff274032ba852dbc20ebbfc74dbda664df707f8f4dd4e80f618cb28",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p142-06600-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-066",
      "parentFingerprint": "1122ba200b82a59f2a44f24141c152a834b51a04ca6a0440f133d95726265943",
      "passageSha256": "154ac959f8335d31b8092cc45eca913c7a28095e632cdb42cd8505e3b12321d6",
      "pdfPages": [
        143
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Before reaching the book’s conclusion, I want to touch on two remaining questions.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7ac8337eb22001df4b03a09efb0a138a562e2891490f961f04ef01ab4c93b98c",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-102",
      "parentFingerprint": "6fc98e626d92fa4fe9b90a13705e4ca7fb64a4a874b2e6f6cd647420e726616a",
      "passageSha256": "6a1b87c833e8c83e3bc7669e74da0effe5a2863c5de9c4f1bffa28ee5a48b725",
      "pdfPages": [
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0002",
      "sentenceId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-s002",
      "sentenceText": "I hope by now you agree that there is a point to a life of exploration, curiosity, and psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5433c25b603c71a19140add502fda8a4989a55bb0e57b19c5aab9a1d40d26d49",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-102",
      "parentFingerprint": "6fc98e626d92fa4fe9b90a13705e4ca7fb64a4a874b2e6f6cd647420e726616a",
      "passageSha256": "6a1b87c833e8c83e3bc7669e74da0effe5a2863c5de9c4f1bffa28ee5a48b725",
      "pdfPages": [
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0003",
      "sentenceId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Second, most of the facilitators of psychological richness that I have discussed so far are on the side of “go” rather than “stay.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "28363edf3776aff4d5cdbbea8109c1526c5409c2e1ec18ff09f678c60cc0645b",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-opening-p144-b005-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-103",
      "parentFingerprint": "d07b91d99ffed74d13d59c45bef7350bf5b0cb4a6298a9176e6f50167f5b9392",
      "passageSha256": "335f2421a50daedd0278b98dd3cb97b98d0197d94269553237b1d81daeae32a2",
      "pdfPages": [
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0004",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p144-05392-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Most people agree that you cannot be too rich when it comes to material wealth.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0253294abf43f933870973b4c9c4c874aa0cf0a9896c146dcea49516d481fec0",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p144-05392-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "b76a0359ba4431f114b2b3a62edb50524351d8365ffd328a0353d7f720751b98",
      "passageSha256": "e06ae950067dfce8569fe92bc6b63ace02a75c214b26b0bb59e6672b8bcff68f",
      "pdfPages": [
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0005",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p144-05392-s003",
      "sentenceText": "I started my book with The Clash’s “Should I Stay or Should I Go?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "9eabc8785083e266bcd546a1009df34f40f03bb5302d4bd10a9de5df16ef3664",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p144-05392-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "b76a0359ba4431f114b2b3a62edb50524351d8365ffd328a0353d7f720751b98",
      "passageSha256": "e06ae950067dfce8569fe92bc6b63ace02a75c214b26b0bb59e6672b8bcff68f",
      "pdfPages": [
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0006",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p144-06368-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Uli Schimmack and I analyzed the Midlife in the United States (MIDUS) data that were collected in 1995 and again in 2005.",
      "sentenceSha256": "24b6aaf4021f42ccdabe62aa6b6391e3a8c50d7073e06a405956898e990be854",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p144-06368-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "290daa0e6afe29f211e6c48a8b9fc3d7df7559c27abb112e9cee14675d82fe82",
      "passageSha256": "ccd2815f9cc4e6a34d104cde7c72d0041d3a810f21cc45e763b3ac742592e1ad",
      "pdfPages": [
        144,
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p144-06368-s002",
      "sentenceText": "MIDUS, organized by the prominent well-being researcher Carol Ryff, included multiple indicators of well-being as well as information regarding how many times participants moved in childhood.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9c8b8054dd4e4b0b34133c60d51a89d8511b59999038c010abc42d83ac0a9c86",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p144-06368-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "290daa0e6afe29f211e6c48a8b9fc3d7df7559c27abb112e9cee14675d82fe82",
      "passageSha256": "ccd2815f9cc4e6a34d104cde7c72d0041d3a810f21cc45e763b3ac742592e1ad",
      "pdfPages": [
        144,
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In response, I received numerous emails from Times readers and others.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6730233f89eb0323b8e854b9be2ea5960cca54c446d60d0bbe4c0190776752f8",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "8156cda555060d5487d82bf5be05fbc7307e1d2e64bcd0daf2b38f1aaa730117",
      "passageSha256": "75963fddda99f2ec510dcd7ac27b53e22d1c2f20abc6f1747faaaaa39f6d9aac",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-s004",
      "sentenceText": "At that point, we had not articulated the concept of psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "94b44d52a29da53761d77d31cea0b876da03a8888adf25d8f4783d44c4f0e076",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "8156cda555060d5487d82bf5be05fbc7307e1d2e64bcd0daf2b38f1aaa730117",
      "passageSha256": "75963fddda99f2ec510dcd7ac27b53e22d1c2f20abc6f1747faaaaa39f6d9aac",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Many who moved around as children reported continued difficulties in adulthood.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f51efa342a4dcf707a38853e839ddb2664f0e136ce635865f43383d7ac154434",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "b151c192c5f93cfb82063dec1571316c8cd91389da412c21799465f9401b346d",
      "passageSha256": "fc812f4bd870e27bb58e95147d4ed8bec3d9bb037994856acc8fff0b7e102bd2",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-s008",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, here is an email from Mary.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e1e22e3076753f91c81cdab359f08d437860ff26a91cea7472b6a57582279d6",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "b151c192c5f93cfb82063dec1571316c8cd91389da412c21799465f9401b346d",
      "passageSha256": "fc812f4bd870e27bb58e95147d4ed8bec3d9bb037994856acc8fff0b7e102bd2",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I read with much interest the New York Times article in the Sunday, July 11 edition.",
      "sentenceSha256": "947ff7419a03223a707fb7a85d57a9fcbf5f8431d405525d7e8570781bbdf13d",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "3510a5e9fb7e1e9566a64d844ec77e692bd951c1e25870eee75146ad5b62870a",
      "passageSha256": "13a66045be00bda77e51cbefb0e3b02087d2a5bf97d59577ea994798d6c7ddd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-s003",
      "sentenceText": "It has always seemed like such an unlikely thing to have impacted my life in such a way and sometimes I even feel guilty bringing it up.",
      "sentenceSha256": "432cabb813080430df6d57afa2f90a32cbfec3c4103366c774f2d0b0fdaa1480",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "3510a5e9fb7e1e9566a64d844ec77e692bd951c1e25870eee75146ad5b62870a",
      "passageSha256": "13a66045be00bda77e51cbefb0e3b02087d2a5bf97d59577ea994798d6c7ddd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Mary",
      "sentenceSha256": "aebac53c46bbeff10fdd26ca0e2196a9bfc1d19bf88eb1efd65a36151c581051",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-03862-r004-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "141a2f2b4ceeeb74043d197cae8a5d9b82d5e3b10c9c558de3774404795e619c",
      "passageSha256": "4fc2e98069b8a40191003e18a0d0f483aa8c8345d4181f7c1e7fadc5afc8a6ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Many others expressed similar struggles.",
      "sentenceSha256": "73a9899d65a904d7fe397a1009857fd01285a57fc390c4525c63bf3dd4e000fa",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "e285eea39b582e0473875b411f82c24e094b45c881172015e5efa5e55d513d68",
      "passageSha256": "0a8249742d64c1dc908fd4aab9a43624f032ed3367f8bf0af0c81fa3fb0a53c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Like Mary, Liz went to eleven schools in multiple countries, called herself “one of those children…it was a constant move, move, move.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "c473221895053e48826e0f67960a14b5d8bcf2294fe000574a9736787de649d9",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "e285eea39b582e0473875b411f82c24e094b45c881172015e5efa5e55d513d68",
      "passageSha256": "0a8249742d64c1dc908fd4aab9a43624f032ed3367f8bf0af0c81fa3fb0a53c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0017",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s003",
      "sentenceText": "She also went in and out of psychiatric units, but psychiatrists could not find anything wrong.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d396706a1c880248eeaa5ddfe034eeddff4fdf1388796a7745949ac3e6641b98",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "e285eea39b582e0473875b411f82c24e094b45c881172015e5efa5e55d513d68",
      "passageSha256": "0a8249742d64c1dc908fd4aab9a43624f032ed3367f8bf0af0c81fa3fb0a53c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Twenty-year-old Gus faced similar issues.",
      "sentenceSha256": "439d279b5eee1e1430e7be50542961025ed60cd1fa45b93b7fda4caaa6dccdb0",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "4ebe7d58ae360dfcdb85638a11fe490ebf13a2462fb71734a1f512e2185034ff",
      "passageSha256": "8b35fa1013ce33b0a09035f26066cf9c1fb11a2cd6081f25065cb6c523773d5f",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s008",
      "sentenceText": "At the end of his email, he wrote, “I feel so lost.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "a4a71ef23d3a12835612f0179e3ef3eb27f06e90f4e92c8d2ae12bc0f6de30f3",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "4ebe7d58ae360dfcdb85638a11fe490ebf13a2462fb71734a1f512e2185034ff",
      "passageSha256": "8b35fa1013ce33b0a09035f26066cf9c1fb11a2cd6081f25065cb6c523773d5f",
      "pdfPages": [
        145
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Finally, Jim, sixty-one years old, went to eight grade schools and three high schools.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4e78921b8b2c0e91e50562b0bd13579004e42c611259984fa88397cd069cbae5",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "2c83c43854670324edb438d28e4b8afe2ed48cc498efe069703829d0f08ff5ca",
      "passageSha256": "d46992457e28dff94047486061dd9849e76219e812049bcaba697196b647cb47",
      "pdfPages": [
        145,
        146
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-s013",
      "sentenceText": "I know there are others out there like me.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "68e68701da67bbec3316f76c4601205815a878be09e5bdf521704c10ab2b8bbd",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p145-05618-r012-013",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-012",
